Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Smart Inventory Not Updating
Problem: Clusters not automatically included in smart inventories

Solution:

# Check cluster labels
oc get managedclusters --show-labels

# Verify smart inventory selector
oc describe managedclusterset <smart-inventory-name>

# Check for typos in label selectors
oc get managedclusterset <smart-inventory-name> -o yaml
Issue 2: Policy Not Applying to Smart Inventory
Problem: Policies not applying to clusters in smart inventory

Solution:

# Check placement rule
oc describe placementrule <placement-rule-name>

# Verify policy binding
oc describe placementbinding <binding-name>

# Check policy status
oc get policy <policy-name> -o yaml | grep -A 20 status
Issue 3: Performance Issues with Large Smart Inventories
Problem: Slow updates with many clusters

Solution:

# Use more specific label selectors
# Avoid complex matchExpressions when possible
# Monitor cluster controller logs
oc logs -n open-cluster-management deployment/cluster-manager -f
